==== hyperbricks yaml {!{image}} ====
image:
  - type: image
  - alt: cat but cute
  - attributes:
      usemap: '#catmap'
  - class: class-a class-b class-c
  - id: '#cat'
  - quality: "90"
  - src: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg
  - title: Some Cute Cat!
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====

==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "cat but cute",
  "Class": "class-a class-b class-c",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGE>",
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": {
    "usemap": "#catmap"
  },
  "Height": 0,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "#cat",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 90,
  "Src": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/cute_cat.jpg",
  "Title": "Some Cute Cat!",
  "Width": 100
}

==== expected output ====
 <img src="static/images/cute_cat_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="cat but cute" title="Some Cute Cat!" class="class-a class-b class-c" id="#cat" usemap="#catmap" /> 
